OL,3,GNEWSAArtists include sound and vision
OL,4,Ain their new mural
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new community mural will be heard as
OL,7,Fwell as seen when it is unveiled,
OL,8,Faccording to its creators.
OL,10,FArtists Karen Le Roy Harris and Esther
OL,11,FRose Parkes have been creating the
OL,12,Fmural on Pier Road in St Helier to
OL,13,Freplace the previous artwork which had
OL,14,Foverlooked the steps to Ordnance Yard
OL,15,Ffor more than 25 years.
OL,17,FTheir work goes beyond just paint and
OL,18,Fcolour. Alongside the art on the wall,
OL,19,FIslanders will be able to scan a QR
OL,20,Fcode and listen to an original song
OL,21,Fcreated using words and ideas gathered
OL,22,Ffrom community workshops.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
