OL,3,GNEWSAArtists include sound and vision
OL,4,Ain their new mural
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mural was commissioned by Jersey
OL,7,FHeritage and takes inspiration from its
OL,8,FLa Terr'rie d'Jerri exhibition at the
OL,9,FJersey Museum.
